This directory contains a substantially modified fork of TradingAgents:
Multi-Agents LLM Financial Trading Framework.

  Original work: Copyright Tauric Research
  https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

  Paper: Xiao, Y., Sun, E., Luo, D., & Wang, W. (2024).
  TradingAgents: Multi-Agents LLM Financial Trading Framework.
  arXiv:2412.20138.

Major modifications relative to upstream include: an idea-generation tier
(mandate-driven sourcing desks with a reviewing/compiling head), a selection
committee (three scoring lenses plus a chair owning the idea brief), analyst
review-and-revise loops, a pre-mortem stage, an independent risk authority
signing binding constraints with a portfolio-manager compliance handshake,
funding (portfolio construction) and execution stages writing to a portfolio
state, multi-provider LLM client work, and prompt/schema redesign throughout.
